opt/messageNumbering/on
opt/title/Basic SIP call through a proxy
guy/a/Alice^UA
guy/p/Proxy
guy/b/Bob^UA
a->p/INVITE^SDP A
!!Alice offers PCMU and Opus.
p->a/100 Trying
!Stops INVITE retransmits from Alice.
p->b/INVITE^SDP A
b->p/180 Ringing
p->a/180 Ringing
note/b/Phone rings
b->p/200 OK^SDP B
!!Bob answers. SDP B selects Opus.
p->a/200 OK^SDP B
a->b/ACK
!!ACK goes end to end.
!The proxy did not Record-Route.
a..b/RTP (Opus)
a->a/Hold timer
b->p/BYE/200 OK
p->a/BYE/200 OK
